    "Access | Tokiwa University\nGo to global navigation\nRead the article\nGo to local navigation\nGo to footer\nAccess\nHome\n>\nAccess\nYou must enable JavaScript for the print button to appear.\nAccess\nFrom Downtown Tokyo to Mito\nTake a Joban Line(Japan Railways;JR) train for Mito at Ueno.\nIt takes about 65 minutes by the Japan Railways (JR) express train.\nTake a JR Highway Bus for Mito at Tokyo Station and get off at the Jiyugaika Bus Stop.\nIt takes about 100 minutes from Tokyo to Mito.\nFrom Mito Station to Tokiwa University\nTake a bus from Stop #5 at Mito Station (North Exit). It takes about 20 minutes from the station to the Jiyugaoka Bus Stop. Some buses go directly to Tokiwa University, but the service is limited\nAccess\nGo to Home\nGo to Page Top\n1-430-1,Miwa Mito, Ibaraki, Japan 310-8585\nPhone:+81-29-232-2511\ncopyright © Tokiwa University All rights reserved."
